/backend/src/MedicalAssistant.Migrations/                           @georgekarounias  # dual-review: schema migration
/clinical-knowledge/src/MedicalAssistance.Ingestion.Api/Ingestions/Migrations/      @georgekarounias  # dual-review: schema migration; overrides the /clinical-knowledge/ line above

# ---- Cross-system Quality (Quality Engineering) ----
